OL,5,G0400 Owain Wyn Evans
OL,6,     FWelcome! It's Early Breakfast with
OL,7,     FOwain Wyn Evans, featuring Airdrum
OL,8,     FAnthems. We celebrate the
OL,9,     Fcompletion of the 4 Nations Cycle
OL,10,     Ffor BBC Children in Need.
OL,11,G0630 The Sara Cox Breakfast Show
OL,12,     FThe original Elphaba in Wicked and
OL,13,     Fthe voice behind Elsa in Frozen,
OL,14,     FIdina Menzel joins Sara. Plus, our
OL,15,     Fdaily register of younger
OL,16,     Flisteners in Kids In A Car!
OL,17,G0930 Vernon Kay
OL,18,     FVernon's mid-morning fun includes
OL,19,     Fdelving into the BBC archive in
OL,20,     FVernon's Vault and U2 discuss two
OL,21,     Fmore of their song choices in
OL,22,     FTracks Of My Years.
